<title>SWEDEN: Swedish official car regs up 30.6 pct in October.</title>
<headline>Swedish official car regs up 30.6 pct in October.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish new car registrations rose by 30.6 percent to 22,553 cars in October compared to the same month in 1995, Statistics Sweden said on Friday.</p>
<p>An increase of 40.9 percent from October 1995 levels was noted for trucks, with 1,882 trucks registered.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46 8 700-1017</p>
</text>
